14:T68d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a good conversion rate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends heavily on industry and traffic source. Ecommerce average is 1.5–3%, with top performers hitting 4–5%+. Lead generation pages average 2–5%. SaaS free trial pages average 3–8%. The most important metric is your own conversion rate trend — is it improving or declining?"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you need a lot of traffic for CRO to work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Statistically valid A/B testing requires sufficient traffic — typically 500–1,000+ visitors per variant per test. For lower-traffic sites, we use qualitative CRO methods: expert heuristic review, heatmaps and session analysis to make high-confidence improvements without waiting for statistical significance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is CRO different from UX design?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"UX design creates the user experience. CRO tests and refines it based on behavioral data. Good CRO is built on good UX thinking, but proves its hypotheses with real user behavior rather than design intuition alone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you improve conversion rates without A/B testing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Expert CRO review, heatmap analysis and session recording analysis often reveal clear, high-confidence fixes — broken form fields, unclear CTAs, trust signal gaps, mobile layout failures — that don't require A/B testing to justify implementing. We start with what's obviously broken before running structured tests."}}]}9:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) Services\",\"description\":\"Data-driven CRO agency for websites, landing pages and ecommerce stores. Heatmaps, session recordings, A/B testing and UX improvements that turn more of your existing traffic into revenue.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/conversion-rate-optimization\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$14"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-glow"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"wrap","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"crumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/#services","children":"Growth Services"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"sep","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"here","children":"Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) Services"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"svc-hero-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"CRO Agency"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"svc-title","style":{"marginTop":18},"children":"Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) Services"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"svc-lead","children":"Conversion rate optimization services are how businesses get more revenue from the traffic they're already paying for — without increasing ad spend or redesigning everything at once. Every dollar you spend on traffic becomes more valuable when more of those visitors convert, and conversion rate optimization services are the most direct lever for improving that ratio. Agentix provides conversion rate optimization services for ecommerce stores, SaaS products, service business websites and lead generation landing pages — working from behavioral data, not guesswork. Whether you need ecommerce conversion optimization for a Shopify store, website conversion optimization for a service site, or ongoing CRO consulting, our CRO agency delivers measurable improvement. Our conversion rate optimization services combine analytics, heatmaps, session recording and structured A/B testing to identify and fix the friction points costing you conversions."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]]}]]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]]
